{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfBbbdGk5HsWawvfwE4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll work through the credit-limit increase decision for Acme Manufacturing's request CR-9202 systematically.\n\n## 1. The Request\n- **ID**: CR-9202\n- **Customer**: Acme Manufacturing (Acme Mfg. Holdings, ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730)\n- **Current limit**: $250,000\n- **Requested limit**: $650,000\n- **Date**: 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor**: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive, Sales)\n- **Basis**: Standard (operational need; third-party guarantee also in force)\n\n## 2. The Customer\nAll records refer to the same company: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048, C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730), 2200 N Industrial Pkwy, Milwaukee, WI.\n\n## 3. Policy\nRequest dated 2026-09-23 falls under **CREDIT-POLICY-2026** (in force 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n## 4. Payment History\nUnder CREDIT-POLICY-2026, no invoice may be paid or remain unpaid more than 30 days after due date in the 12 months before the request (2025-09-23 to 2026-09-23).\n\nInvoices in lookback period:\n- **INV-60412**: due 2025-11-28, paid 2025-11-24 → 4 days *early* ✓\n- **INV-62011**: due 2026-07-25, paid 2026-07-22 → 3 days *early* ✓\n- **INV-62305**: due 2026-10-02, unpaid → outside lookback window (after request date)\n\n**Payment history: compliant.**\n\n## 5. Maximum Credit Limit\n- **Account tier** (CRM): Strategic\n- **Policy maximum for Strategic**: $750,000\n- **Parent guarantee in force**: GRT-ACME-2026 (Acme Group Holdings guarantees Acme Mfg. Holdings/C-1001 for $400,000, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31)\n- **Guarantee applies**: covers this customer on this date\n- **Total maximum**: $750,000 + $400,000 = **$1,150,000**\n\nRequested limit **$650,000 < $1,150,000** ✓\n\n**Eligibility: eligible.**\n\n## 6. Requestor's Authority\nSarah Chen is Enterprise Account Executive (Sales). Credit policy assigns no approval authority to Sales roles. She cannot approve alone.\n\n## 7. Required Approvers\nUnder CREDIT-POLICY-2026, for a $650,000 limit on a Strategic account:\n\n- **Approval**: \"Credit limits greater than $500,000 require Director of Finance approval\"\n  - **Director of Finance**: Elena Novak (EMP-402)\n\n- **Concurrence**: \"For Strategic accounts, credit limits greater than $500,000 also require VP Sales concurrence\"\n  - **VP Sales**: Michael Torres (EMP-200)\n\nNo separation-of-duty conflict: Sarah Chen submitted the request but is not the approver or concurrer.\n\n## 8. Outcome\nThe customer is eligible for the requested limit, but the policy requires both Director of Finance approval and VP Sales concurrence.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9202\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (Acme Mfg. Holdings, C-1001)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 650000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 1150000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic tier base $750,000 + GRT-ACME-2026 parent guarantee $400,000\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance (approval); VP Sales (concurrence)\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\"name\": \"Elena Novak\", \"role\": \"Director of Finance\", \"kind\": \"approval\"},\n      {\"name\": \"Michael Torres\", \"role\": \"VP Sales\", \"kind\": \"concurrence\"}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 in force for request dated 2026-09-23\",\n    \"Account classified Strategic in CRM\",\n    \"Requested limit $650,000 exceeds $500,000 threshold (policy §3, §4)\",\n    \"Payment history compliant: 12-month lookback shows no invoices more than 30 days late\",\n    \"GRT-ACME-2026 in effect 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31, guarantees C-1001 up to $400,000\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5186,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5186},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36901398-02c0-46d1-b002-40f70acd5ca7","uuid":"780947b1-f3c2-4368-b8a8-35b0d51c0cdb","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:05:09.702Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfBb9aTy3QLmj4pxhyc"}
